OL,3,AAbusive ex admits murdering woman after
OL,4,Ashe began new relationship
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with a history of domestic abuse
OL,7,Fhas admitted murdering his former
OL,8,Fpartner a day after learning she had
OL,9,Fbegun another relationship.
OL,11,FLee Inglis pled guilty at the High
OL,12,FCourt in Edinburgh to stabbing Stacey
OL,13,FHogg to death in her home in Hawick
OL,14,Fearlier this year.
OL,16,FBBC Scotland News has learned that the
OL,17,F39-year-old had twice avoided prison
OL,18,Ffor previous knife attacks on the
OL,19,Fmother of three.
